<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We enjoy You, Lord Jesus,</l><l>In our experience.</l><l>We’re getting to know You—</l><l>It’s making us leap and dance.</l><l>Just eating and drinking,</l><l>It’s what we do the best,</l><l>Delighting in the love of the Lord.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>We’re walking, not running,</l><l>Cause we’re in the pasture land.</l><l>Our Shepherd is nearby,</l><l>We’re trusting in His hand.</l><l>He’s everything to us,</l><l>He’s all we ever need,</l><l>Resting in the peace of the Lord.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
